  "source_commit": "f47df33e2a60ad822dceccc8ccc5d0b863f2a15b",
  "manifest": "plans/acceptance/alpha-portable-tests-20261105/MANIFEST.json",
  "scope": "Synthetic stores and disposable folders. The frozen evidence and its restore tool stay on the kept source branch.",
  "excluded": [
    "The 30 tests the manifest marks as left behind, with their reasons.",
    "Logs, XML results, receipts and zip files from the original packets."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "All packages: package-relative imports replace packet loaders, frozen-file hash checks and script entry points; normal lint and formatting apply; dependency-list and other left-behind tests are omitted per the manifest.",
    "embedding_artifacts_unit: packet run folders become normal temp folders with a canonical root; the synthetic CLI's root check now requires the parent test's temp root and a CAIRNTIR_HOME beneath it; the review controls' machine path is removed.",
    "embedding_artifacts_unit: tests 18, 19, 22 and 26 expect CHUNK_PREFIX + provider identity on stored identity, because the alpha labels its chunk policy there. Exact comparison retained.",
    "embedding_artifacts_unit: the CLI subprocess timeout rises from 15 to 120 seconds for slower CI hosts; CLI trace files are no longer written; __init__.py preloads the CLI and MCP server so patch.dict(sys.modules) cannot unload their imports between tests; a loop callback binds its loop variables; nested with statements are merged.",
    "obsidian_integration_unit: the plugin harness keeps its originals/ subfolder so test_real_plugin.cjs stays byte-for-byte; the actual-process timeout rises from 60 to 120 seconds; test_missing_node_fails_instead_of_skipping is added; dict() fixtures become literals.",
    "questions_durable_unit: both routers share node_executable with an environment-based Windows fallback; the actual-process timeout rises from 60 to 120 seconds; test_missing_node_fails_instead_of_skipping is added; the rollback helper exception gains an Error suffix.",
    "managed_runtime_unit: only tests named in the manifest are copied; the alpha's own managed tests cover the rest. The parametrized request argument is renamed envelope_request because pytest 9 reserves request; the JSON key is unchanged.",
    "managed_runtime_unit: test_cli_changed_config_cannot_launch_using_previous_ack and test_real_cli_jsonl_start_capture_brief_ack_dispatch_close replace a downloaded model with a sitecustomize shim selecting HashEmbeddingProvider; they remain real separate processes.",
    "managed_runtime_unit: the two projection source files merge into one module that imports the alpha's existing projection fixture; remaining lint exceptions are per-line noqa annotations on the carried code.",
    "embedding_artifacts_unit: cli_synthetic_process.py drops --source-root and its sys.path insertion, so the child imports the cairntir its environment provides rather than pinning a checkout.",
    "embedding_artifacts_unit: test_artifact_refusals.py removes Controls.record and OBSERVATIONS, moves shared setup onto a test-free ControlsFixture base so inherited tests are not collected twice, moves prepare_hub onto HubControl, and replaces the per-test script loaders with ordinary classes."
  ],
